                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is realistic Shopify build cost for skincare in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 2-4L Boutique (4-6 weeks) + Rs 4-8L Mid-market (6-10 weeks) + Rs 8-15L Enterprise (10-16 weeks) + Rs 12-25L Headless (12-18 weeks). Choose based on projected 24-month revenue + SKU count + feature complexity.</p>
                                        <h3>What are monthly Shopify + apps costs for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 15-30K Boutique + Rs 30-80K Mid-market + Rs 80K-2L Enterprise. Includes Shopify plan + skin quiz + subscription + WhatsApp + reviews + email + shipping insurance + analytics.</p>
                                        <h3>What does Dubai Shopify skincare build cost?</h3>
                                        <p>AED 9-18K Boutique + AED 18-36K Mid-market + AED 36-70K Enterprise. Multi-currency AED + SAR + USD + EUR + trilingual Arabic + English + Hindi common. Halal certification display + Arabic RTL layout add complexity.</p>
                                        <h3>What skincare-specific features drive Shopify cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Skin quiz + routine builder (Rs 1-3L integration) + subscription + refill (Rs 1-2L) + WhatsApp Cloud API (Rs 80K-1.5L) + certification display (Rs 30-60K) + ingredient encyclopaedia (Rs 80K-1.5L) + AR try-on (Rs 1.5-3L) + multi-currency + multi-language.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we build Shopify Plus or regular Shopify?</h3>
                                        <p>Regular for Rs 15L-1.5 Cr/month projected revenue. Plus for Rs 1.5-25 Cr/month + wholesale + B2B. Headless for Rs 5 Cr+/month + performance-critical + custom-heavy. Migrate up as revenue scales.</p>
                                        <h3>What is realistic post-launch Shopify retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 40K-2L / month. Feature dev + updates + CRO + A/B + bug fixes + analytics. Growth + Enterprise brands bundle Shopify + marketing retainer for continuity.</p>
                                        <h3>Is headless Shopify worth the cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Only at Rs 5+ Cr/month revenue + performance-critical + custom-feature-heavy. Below scale, regular Shopify + apps delivers 90% of headless value at 30-50% cost. Migrate later if genuinely needed.</p>
                                        <h3>Does ITD build skincare Shopify + also run marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes end-to-end. Shopify + skincare-specific apps + post-launch retainer + marketing (paid + SEO + content + WhatsApp + influencer). Continuity across build + growth + iteration. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
